      "tr": "Düzeltme `y - theta * (x - x.mean())`.",
      "en": "The adjustment is `y - theta * (x - x.mean())`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Yalnızca son satır değişiyor.",
      "en": "Only the last line changes."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef cuped_adjust(y, x):\n    y, x = np.asarray(y, float), np.asarray(x, float)\n    theta = np.cov(x, y)[0, 1] / x.var(ddof=1)\n    return [round(float(v), 3) for v in y - theta * (x - x.mean())]\n\n\nprint(cuped_adjust([5, 7, 9, 12], [1, 2, 3, 4]))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef cuped_adjust(y, x):\n    y, x = np.asarray(y, float), np.asarray(x, float)\n    theta = np.cov(x, y)[0, 1] / x.var(ddof=1)\n    return [round(float(v), 3) for v in y - theta * (x - x.mean())]\n\n\nprint(cuped_adjust([5, 7, 9, 12], [1, 2, 3, 4]))\n```"
    }
  ],
